{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the robot Automavoz on a whimsical Steampunk-flavored quest to help the Wizard of Voz save the town of Songburg from the gang of interdimensional art thieves known only as the Dream Stealers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town of Songburg, and meet its quirky residents as you search for the shattered pieces of the Wizard's invention, the Songshiner.\u00a0 Visit the Art Gallery, Library, Cinema and many other locations!\u00a0 Travel through portals to the Dreamstealers' realm, and collect the stolen pieces there!\u00a0 Upgrade Automavoz's abilities, and maybe find him some sporty new hats along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving Songburg\u2122 is a 3D third-person action-adventure platformer, set in a whimsical Steampunk world, developed by Ken Calloway for Songshine\u00ae Creative.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954920?t=1767372857","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954920/ca96b8cfbd529167ddeab95178ca1dd244fea8e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767372857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954920/3efbad4ed8883a565d7bb63b7a0f24a6299e8968/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767372857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954920/3efbad4ed8883a565d7bb63b7a0f24a6299e8968/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767372857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join